  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Where trust remains",
      "items": [
        "The kernel checks proof terms; it cannot decide whether people chose a strong, accurate theorem.",
        "The security claim also depends on the AArch64 model, trusted routine contracts, cryptographic assumptions, and the modeled environment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Scope of this case study",
      "items": [
        "The paper analyzes selected one-to-one libsignal properties in a command-line harness.",
